ments to provide the right information on project estimations to Technology Leads and Project Managers.\n* You would be a key contributor to building efficient programs/ systems and if you think you fit right in to help our clients navigate their next in their digital transformation journey, this is the place for you! If you think you fit right in to help our clients navigate their next in their digital transformation journey, this is the place for you! Infosys Equinox is a human\\-centric digital commerce platform that helps brands provide an omnichannel and memorable shopping experience to their customers. With a future\\-ready architecture and integrated commerce ecosystem, Infosys Equinox provides an end\\-to\\-end commerce platform covering all facets of an enterprise\u2019s e\\-commerce needs. Area of Responsibility: Actively participate in the Requirement analysis and grooming activity. Actively participate and understand the Design specifications for the requirements to be built. Produce clean and efficient code based on the design specifications. Need to ensure all code thus produced meets all the quality checks including Standards and Guidelines, SonarQube, Unit Test Coverage etc. Unit test the developed code for bugs and fix them accordingly. Verify and deploy the code changes to appropriate environment(s). Troubleshoot, debug issues for the deployment and provide fixes accordingly. Provide necessary support for the release and fix issues with priority. Documentation updates for Troubleshooting, FAQs, Deployment/Release notes, Macro updates etc. Mentor Software Trainees and Software Developers in their day to day work. Train newly joined Software Trainees and Developers to perform their tasks. Full Stack Developer \\- Cross Skill with other technologies used across the Platform/ implementation. Good analytical ability and problem solving skills. Highly proficient in coding standards \\& best practices and code quality. Good understanding of the functional capabilities of the platform. Full Stack developer. Good communication skills \\- both oral and written. Agile methodologies, processes and rituals. Quick learner to skill up on the required technologies, process and tools.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4462985179","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4462985179"},{"title":"Trainee Software Developer - MERN Stack, AWS & AI Integration {Training Cum Employment Program}","company":"Appin Technology Coimbatore","location":"Coimbatore","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4463534022","experience":"Fresher","skills":[1,3,13,14,20,21,25],"is_walkin":false,"description":"We're hiring trainee developers into a structured 8\\-week Training\\-cum\\-Employment Program \u2014 with a conditional offer of employment issued on Day 1\\. Selection based on Interviews Only.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Appin Technology Coimbatore is building out our Custom built AI CRM and looking for motivated freshers who want real, hands\\-on experience on a live product \u2014 not just theory.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n How the program works:\n \n\n\n\n \ud83d\udccc Day 1: You receive a conditional offer letter, subject to completing interview and joining process\n \n\n\n\n \ud83d\udccc Weeks 1\u20138: Structured, mentor\\-led training \u2014 you build real modules of our CRM\n \n\n\n\n \ud83d\udccc Month 3 onward: Move into paid employment on successful completion of assessments\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \u00a0What you'll learn \\& build:\n \n\n\n\n \u2705 Node.js \\& Express.js \u2014 REST API design\n \n\n\n\n \u2705 MongoDB \u2014 schema design \\& aggregation\n \n\n\n\n \u2705 React.js \u2014 production\\-grade frontend\n \n\n\n\n \u2705 Git/GitHub \u2014 real collaborative workflows\n \n\n\n\n \u2705 AWS (EC2 \\+ S3\\) \u2014 deployment \\& cloud infra\n \n\n\n\n \u2705 Microservices architecture fundamentals\n \n\n\n\n \u2705 Meta WhatsApp Business API integration\n \n\n\n\n \u2705 RAG (Retrieval\\-Augmented Generation) \\& LLM integration\n \n\n\n\n \u2705 Python, ML \\& data analytics applied to real CRM data\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Who should apply:\n \n\n\n\n \\- Freshers / final\\-year students with basic JS fundamentals\n \n\n\n\n \\- Genuine interest in full\\-stack \\+ applied AI\n \n\n\n\n \\- Available full\\-time for the 8\\-week training period\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Interested Candidates Apply Here.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#Hiring \\#FresherJobs \\#MERNStack \\#AWS \\#NodeJS \\#ReactJS \\#WhatsAppAPI \\#RAG \\#MachineLearning \\#TrainingProgram \\#CRMDeveloper \\#TechJobs \\#coimbatoreJobs","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4463534022","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4463534022"}]